  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Pattern Standard?\n\nIn theory [RegExpBuiltinExec](https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/text-processing.html#sec-regexpbuiltinexec) has points where it can throw, e.g., step 13.a.i.1. It would be nice to know if this impacts URLPattern.\n\nAnd then you can construct variants of https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/20ebe20f75010b63e78b719250a9b9a5e9333140/LayoutTests/fast/url/invalid-url-pattern-context-crash.html to see if that exception is from the correct realm.\n\ncc @TingPing",
